  "summary_en": "Turkish Personal Data Protection Authority (KVKK) guide issued April 2025 with recommendations for AI developers, manufacturers, service providers and decision makers on protecting personal data under Law No. 6698. It draws on Council of Europe and OECD instruments and stresses privacy by design, impact assessment, human intervention and anonymisation.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "AI systems processing personal data must comply with Law No. 6698 from design onward, with a project-specific data protection compliance programme.",
   "Privacy impact assessment required where high data protection risk is foreseen.",
   "Prefer anonymised data where the same result can be achieved without personal data.",
   "Individuals must not be subject to solely automated decisions; right to object and human intervention should be ensured.",
   "Promote codes of conduct, certification, supervisory authority cooperation and digital literacy training."
  ],
